{"id":"vol9-06","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-06/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":396.04,"segments":[{"start":1.07,"end":6.87,"text":"You will hear a telephone conversation between a woman and a staff member of an airline.","words":[["You",1.07,1.63],["will",1.63,1.81],["hear",1.81,2.07],["a",2.07,2.29],["telephone",2.29,2.67],["conversation",2.67,3.49],["between",3.49,4.27],["a",4.27,4.51],["woman",4.51,4.77],["and",4.77,5.21],["a",5.21,5.35],["staff",5.35,5.57],["member",5.57,5.97],["of",5.97,6.35],["an",6.35,6.49],["airline.",6.49,6.87]]},{"start":7.95,"end":11.85,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions one to four.","words":[["First",7.95,8.55],["you",8.55,8.77],["have",8.77,8.93],["some",8.93,9.13],["time",9.13,9.53],["to",9.53,9.83],["look",9.83,10.03],["at",10.03,10.19],["questions",10.19,10.63],["one",10.63,11.15],["to",11.15,11.39],["four.",11.39,11.85]]},{"start":32.2,"end":35.72,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions one to four.","words":[["Now",32.2,32.54],["listen",32.54,32.9],["carefully",32.9,33.34],["and",33.34,33.74],["answer",33.74,34.1],["questions",34.1,34.56],["one",34.56,35.06],["to",35.06,35.26],["four.",35.26,35.72]]},{"start":39.18,"end":43.46,"text":"Kiwi Air, good morning. You're speaking with Roger. How may I help you?","words":[["Kiwi",39.18,39.62],["Air,",39.62,39.96],["good",40.12,40.22],["morning.",40.22,40.62],["You're",40.9,41.08],["speaking",41.08,41.3],["with",41.3,41.6],["Roger.",41.6,41.94],["How",42.4,42.58],["may",42.58,42.78],["I",42.78,42.92],["help",42.92,43.16],["you?",43.16,43.46]]},{"start":44.06,"end":49.72,"text":"Yes, hi. My name's Janet. I've just been trying to make a booking on the internet.","words":[["Yes,",44.06,44.5],["hi.",44.72,45.12],["My",45.74,45.96],["name's",45.96,46.28],["Janet.",46.28,46.52],["I've",47.1,47.64],["just",47.64,47.84],["been",47.84,48.08],["trying",48.08,48.34],["to",48.34,48.46],["make",48.46,48.64],["a",48.64,48.72],["booking",48.72,48.98],["on",48.98,49.2],["the",49.2,49.3],["internet.",49.3,49.72]]},{"start":49.72,"end":53.0,"text":"and I'm having a problem that I'd like to complain about.","words":[["and",49.72,50.54],["I'm",50.54,50.98],["having",50.98,51.16],["a",51.16,51.34],["problem",51.34,51.6],["that",51.6,51.82],["I'd",51.82,51.98],["like",51.98,52.12],["to",52.12,52.26],["complain",52.26,52.64],["about.",52.64,53.0]]},{"start":53.46,"end":56.22,"text":"So let me just take down your full name.","words":[["So",53.46,53.96],["let",53.96,54.44],["me",54.44,54.58],["just",54.58,54.84],["take",54.84,55.12],["down",55.12,55.36],["your",55.36,55.52],["full",55.52,55.82],["name.",55.82,56.22]]},{"start":56.98,"end":62.92,"text":"It's Janet Quigley. That's Q-U-I-G-L-E-Y.","words":[["It's",56.98,57.34],["Janet",57.34,57.6],["Quigley.",57.6,58.2],["That's",58.76,58.96],["Q",58.96,59.36],["-U",59.36,59.86],["-I",59.86,60.54],["-G",60.54,61.32],["-L",61.32,61.96],["-E",61.96,62.5],["-Y.",62.5,62.92]]},{"start":63.34,"end":65.9,"text":"Thank you. And what's the problem exactly?","words":[["Thank",63.34,63.72],["you.",63.72,63.96],["And",64.36,64.76],["what's",64.76,65.18],["the",65.18,65.3],["problem",65.3,65.6],["exactly?",65.6,65.9]]},{"start":66.68,"end":70.56,"text":"Well, yes. I'm trying to book myself and three children,","words":[["Well,",66.68,66.98],["yes.",67.1,67.4],["I'm",67.96,68.26],["trying",68.26,68.5],["to",68.5,68.62],["book",68.62,68.84],["myself",68.84,69.34],["and",69.34,69.74],["three",69.74,70.04],["children,",70.04,70.56]]},{"start":71.02,"end":74.2,"text":"so four tickets, to fly within New Zealand.","words":[["so",71.02,71.34],["four",71.34,71.8],["tickets,",71.8,72.2],["to",72.78,73.1],["fly",73.1,73.34],["within",73.34,73.6],["New",73.6,73.8],["Zealand.",73.8,74.2]]},{"start":74.76,"end":77.32,"text":"We're wanting to fly from Wellington to Christchurch.","words":[["We're",74.76,75.04],["wanting",75.04,75.22],["to",75.22,75.44],["fly",75.44,75.7],["from",75.7,75.92],["Wellington",75.92,76.24],["to",76.24,76.6],["Christchurch.",76.6,77.32]]},{"start":77.32,"end":84.16,"text":"not one way I mean but return so it's just a simple booking yes and you've put","words":[["not",77.32,77.98],["one",77.98,78.24],["way",78.24,78.6],["I",78.6,79.14],["mean",79.14,79.4],["but",79.4,79.84],["return",79.84,80.38],["so",80.38,81.08],["it's",81.08,81.24],["just",81.24,81.42],["a",81.42,81.56],["simple",81.56,81.8],["booking",81.8,82.1],["yes",82.1,83.14],["and",83.14,83.66],["you've",83.66,83.96],["put",83.96,84.16]]},{"start":84.16,"end":91.92,"text":"your dates in have you yes the dates are um what are we in now it's September","words":[["your",84.16,84.32],["dates",84.32,84.66],["in",84.66,84.88],["have",84.88,85.08],["you",85.08,85.32],["yes",85.32,86.38],["the",86.38,86.8],["dates",86.8,87.12],["are",87.12,87.48],["um",87.48,88.84],["what",88.84,89.92],["are",89.92,90.0],["we",90.0,90.12],["in",90.12,90.26],["now",90.26,90.54],["it's",90.54,91.64],["September",91.64,91.92]]},{"start":91.92,"end":98.42,"text":"isn't it so I'm booking for October oh sorry I mean November the 10th till the","words":[["isn't",91.92,92.2],["it",92.2,92.4],["so",92.4,93.0],["I'm",93.0,93.68],["booking",93.68,93.86],["for",93.86,94.04],["October",94.04,94.48],["oh",94.48,95.38],["sorry",95.38,96.02],["I",96.02,96.18],["mean",96.18,96.38],["November",96.38,97.14],["the",97.14,97.84],["10th",97.84,98.16],["till",98.16,98.32],["the",98.32,98.42]]},{"start":98.42,"end":106.46,"text":"15th right let me just get that down on the form and what time would that be we'd","words":[["15th",98.42,99.3],["right",99.3,99.86],["let",99.86,100.64],["me",100.64,100.78],["just",100.78,101.22],["get",101.22,101.54],["that",101.54,101.76],["down",101.76,102.0],["on",102.0,102.12],["the",102.12,102.22],["form",102.22,102.68],["and",102.68,103.86],["what",103.86,104.22],["time",104.22,104.74],["would",104.74,105.06],["that",105.06,105.3],["be",105.3,105.66],["we'd",105.66,106.46]]},{"start":106.46,"end":111.2,"text":"leaving at 11.45 in the morning, arriving into Christchurch at 12.30.","words":[["leaving",106.46,106.68],["at",106.68,106.98],["11",106.98,107.24],[".45",107.24,107.68],["in",107.68,108.02],["the",108.02,108.1],["morning,",108.1,108.32],["arriving",108.94,109.32],["into",109.32,109.58],["Christchurch",109.58,110.14],["at",110.14,110.5],["12",110.5,110.74],[".30.",110.74,111.2]]},{"start":111.58,"end":112.14,"text":"Mm-hmm.","words":[["Mm",111.58,111.8],["-hmm.",111.8,112.14]]},{"start":113.12,"end":119.06,"text":"I know that it's cheaper to not make the reservation in person, so to save paying the fee, I've","words":[["I",113.12,113.34],["know",113.34,113.5],["that",113.5,113.66],["it's",113.66,113.8],["cheaper",113.8,114.1],["to",114.1,114.96],["not",114.96,115.26],["make",115.26,115.54],["the",115.54,115.66],["reservation",115.66,116.12],["in",116.12,116.28],["person,",116.28,116.66],["so",116.66,117.44],["to",117.44,117.58],["save",117.58,117.84],["paying",117.84,118.1],["the",118.1,118.28],["fee,",118.28,118.58],["I've",118.72,119.06]]},{"start":119.06,"end":120.56,"text":"been trying to do it through your homepage.","words":[["been",119.06,119.18],["trying",119.18,119.48],["to",119.48,119.62],["do",119.62,119.74],["it",119.74,119.84],["through",119.84,119.98],["your",119.98,120.14],["homepage.",120.14,120.56]]},{"start":121.22,"end":123.26,"text":"Yes, so what's the problem exactly?","words":[["Yes,",121.22,121.62],["so",121.84,122.16],["what's",122.16,122.56],["the",122.56,122.66],["problem",122.66,122.96],["exactly?",122.96,123.26]]},{"start":123.86,"end":129.8,"text":"Well, every time I put in the number of adults and children travelling, the website automatically","words":[["Well,",123.86,124.42],["every",124.9,125.38],["time",125.38,125.62],["I",125.62,125.72],["put",125.72,125.86],["in",125.86,125.98],["the",125.98,126.06],["number",126.06,126.34],["of",126.34,126.52],["adults",126.52,126.9],["and",126.9,127.16],["children",127.16,127.44],["travelling,",127.44,127.86],["the",128.6,128.7],["website",128.7,129.04],["automatically",129.04,129.8]]},{"start":129.8,"end":133.82,"text":"alters the rate for one of the children to what you'd pay for an adult.","words":[["alters",129.8,130.3],["the",130.3,130.52],["rate",130.52,130.82],["for",130.82,131.04],["one",131.04,131.32],["of",131.32,131.52],["the",131.52,131.64],["children",131.64,132.08],["to",132.08,132.68],["what",132.68,132.84],["you'd",132.84,133.04],["pay",133.04,133.18],["for",133.18,133.32],["an",133.32,133.42],["adult.",133.42,133.82]]},{"start":133.82,"end":146.12,"text":"It's very annoying. I'm getting so frustrated with it. And each time I change it back, I've been getting error messages telling me to call you directly. I really can't understand it.","words":[["It's",133.82,134.82],["very",134.82,135.04],["annoying.",135.04,135.38],["I'm",136.24,136.5],["getting",136.5,136.7],["so",136.7,136.94],["frustrated",136.94,137.44],["with",137.44,137.88],["it.",137.88,138.06],["And",138.72,138.98],["each",138.98,139.24],["time",139.24,139.5],["I",139.5,139.66],["change",139.66,139.92],["it",139.92,140.06],["back,",140.06,140.38],["I've",140.9,141.16],["been",141.16,141.28],["getting",141.28,141.5],["error",141.5,141.84],["messages",141.84,142.28],["telling",142.28,142.64],["me",142.64,142.82],["to",142.82,142.92],["call",142.92,143.12],["you",143.12,143.28],["directly.",143.28,143.68],["I",144.4,144.54],["really",144.54,144.84],["can't",144.84,145.16],["understand",145.16,145.62],["it.",145.62,146.12]]},{"start":149.73,"end":188.66,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the conversation, you have some time to look at questions 5 to 10. Now listen and answer questions 5 to 10.","words":[["Before",149.73,150.09],["you",150.09,150.35],["hear",150.35,150.57],["the",150.57,150.75],["rest",150.75,150.97],["of",150.97,151.09],["the",151.09,151.17],["conversation,",151.17,151.65],["you",152.33,152.51],["have",152.51,152.69],["some",152.69,152.87],["time",152.87,153.23],["to",153.23,153.47],["look",153.47,153.63],["at",153.63,153.77],["questions",153.77,154.11],["5",154.11,154.67],["to",154.67,154.93],["10.",154.93,155.25],["Now",185.82,186.06],["listen",186.06,186.34],["and",186.34,186.68],["answer",186.68,187.04],["questions",187.04,187.48],["5",187.48,188.06],["to",188.06,188.28],["10.",188.28,188.66]]},{"start":192.2,"end":197.36,"text":"Alright, well yes, there is a reason for why that's happening. It's Kiwi Air policy, I'm","words":[["Alright,",192.2,192.68],["well",192.94,193.08],["yes,",193.08,193.4],["there",193.52,193.62],["is",193.62,193.9],["a",193.9,194.04],["reason",194.04,194.34],["for",194.34,194.56],["why",194.56,194.74],["that's",194.74,195.0],["happening.",195.0,195.26],["It's",195.88,196.1],["Kiwi",196.1,196.44],["Air",196.44,196.66],["policy,",196.66,197.08],["I'm",197.24,197.36]]},{"start":197.36,"end":202.24,"text":"afraid, to allow a maximum of two children to travel on child fares with just the one","words":[["afraid,",197.36,197.72],["to",197.78,198.02],["allow",198.02,198.2],["a",198.2,198.36],["maximum",198.36,198.68],["of",198.68,198.96],["two",198.96,199.24],["children",199.24,199.7],["to",199.7,199.86],["travel",199.86,200.16],["on",200.16,200.38],["child",200.38,200.72],["fares",200.72,201.22],["with",201.22,201.56],["just",201.56,201.8],["the",201.8,202.0],["one",202.0,202.24]]},{"start":202.24,"end":203.58,"text":"adult accompanying them.","words":[["adult",202.24,202.64],["accompanying",202.64,203.18],["them.",203.18,203.58]]},{"start":204.12,"end":209.1,"text":"So because there's three of them and just me, do you mean I have to pay an adult fare","words":[["So",204.12,204.52],["because",204.52,205.0],["there's",205.0,205.42],["three",205.42,205.7],["of",205.7,205.88],["them",205.88,206.12],["and",206.12,206.34],["just",206.34,206.6],["me,",206.6,206.88],["do",207.46,207.62],["you",207.62,207.72],["mean",207.72,207.84],["I",207.84,208.0],["have",208.0,208.12],["to",208.12,208.24],["pay",208.24,208.42],["an",208.42,208.54],["adult",208.54,208.84],["fare",208.84,209.1]]},{"start":209.1,"end":209.92,"text":"for one of my children?","words":[["for",209.1,209.26],["one",209.26,209.4],["of",209.4,209.48],["my",209.48,209.58],["children?",209.58,209.92]]},{"start":210.52,"end":211.46,"text":"Yes, that's right.","words":[["Yes,",210.52,210.9],["that's",210.96,211.24],["right.",211.24,211.46]]},{"start":212.08,"end":216.42,"text":"But I've flown to Australia before on my own with the children and we didn't have","words":[["But",212.08,212.48],["I've",212.48,212.84],["flown",212.84,213.02],["to",213.02,213.2],["Australia",213.2,213.54],["before",213.54,213.9],["on",213.9,214.12],["my",214.12,214.26],["own",214.26,214.56],["with",214.56,214.72],["the",214.72,214.88],["children",214.88,215.24],["and",215.24,215.92],["we",215.92,216.04],["didn't",216.04,216.26],["have",216.26,216.42]]},{"start":216.42,"end":217.04,"text":"to pay extra.","words":[["to",216.42,216.54],["pay",216.54,216.72],["extra.",216.72,217.04]]},{"start":217.04,"end":222.96,"text":"It's a policy that we've just introduced for domestic air travel. It may be extended later","words":[["It's",217.04,217.92],["a",217.92,218.0],["policy",218.0,218.38],["that",218.38,218.6],["we've",218.6,218.78],["just",218.78,218.98],["introduced",218.98,219.52],["for",219.52,219.82],["domestic",219.82,220.28],["air",220.28,220.68],["travel.",220.68,221.04],["It",221.5,221.8],["may",221.8,222.04],["be",222.04,222.18],["extended",222.18,222.54],["later",222.54,222.96]]},{"start":222.96,"end":224.76,"text":"for international travel as well.","words":[["for",222.96,223.18],["international",223.18,223.72],["travel",223.72,224.24],["as",224.24,224.4],["well.",224.4,224.76]]},{"start":225.3,"end":231.88,"text":"But an adult fare is for someone over the age of 12? My children are only 11, 8 and 5.","words":[["But",225.3,225.68],["an",225.68,225.92],["adult",225.92,226.22],["fare",226.22,226.48],["is",226.48,226.66],["for",226.66,226.8],["someone",226.8,227.04],["over",227.04,227.54],["the",227.54,227.72],["age",227.72,227.96],["of",227.96,228.1],["12?",228.1,228.46],["My",229.06,229.38],["children",229.38,229.66],["are",229.66,229.88],["only",229.88,230.1],["11,",230.1,230.5],["8",230.8,231.26],["and",231.26,231.5],["5.",231.5,231.88]]},{"start":232.4,"end":237.68,"text":"It's not fair to charge them for an adult rate. Besides, they actually eat less than","words":[["It's",232.4,232.68],["not",232.68,232.82],["fair",232.82,233.14],["to",233.14,233.32],["charge",233.32,233.64],["them",233.64,233.8],["for",233.8,233.98],["an",233.98,234.1],["adult",234.1,234.36],["rate.",234.36,234.72],["Besides,",235.24,235.8],["they",236.32,236.54],["actually",236.54,236.9],["eat",236.9,237.18],["less",237.18,237.46],["than",237.46,237.68]]},{"start":237.68,"end":242.42,"text":"an adult, so they wouldn't consume as much food on the plane. I just don't think","words":[["an",237.68,237.82],["adult,",237.82,238.12],["so",238.42,238.8],["they",238.8,239.02],["wouldn't",239.02,239.28],["consume",239.28,239.74],["as",239.74,239.94],["much",239.94,240.2],["food",240.2,240.5],["on",240.5,240.64],["the",240.64,240.74],["plane.",240.74,241.04],["I",241.66,241.84],["just",241.84,242.04],["don't",242.04,242.26],["think",242.26,242.42]]},{"start":242.42,"end":242.98,"text":"it's right.","words":[["it's",242.42,242.64],["right.",242.64,242.98]]},{"start":242.98,"end":249.32,"text":"Well, I'm sorry, but that's how we charge. We do look after children well on our flights,","words":[["Well,",242.98,243.9],["I'm",243.98,244.1],["sorry,",244.1,244.56],["but",244.72,244.88],["that's",244.88,245.32],["how",245.32,245.46],["we",245.46,245.6],["charge.",245.6,246.04],["We",246.92,247.28],["do",247.28,247.44],["look",247.44,247.66],["after",247.66,248.0],["children",248.0,248.36],["well",248.36,248.66],["on",248.66,248.84],["our",248.84,248.98],["flights,",248.98,249.32]]},{"start":249.52,"end":253.7,"text":"you know. We give them little packs of games and coloured pencils so they have something","words":[["you",249.52,249.6],["know.",249.6,249.76],["We",250.04,250.32],["give",250.32,250.48],["them",250.48,250.62],["little",250.62,250.8],["packs",250.8,251.12],["of",251.12,251.36],["games",251.36,251.8],["and",251.8,252.08],["coloured",252.08,252.36],["pencils",252.36,252.86],["so",252.86,253.2],["they",253.2,253.34],["have",253.34,253.44],["something",253.44,253.7]]},{"start":253.7,"end":254.7,"text":"to do, you know.","words":[["to",253.7,253.88],["do,",253.88,254.18],["you",254.4,254.54],["know.",254.54,254.7]]},{"start":255.24,"end":260.66,"text":"Well, still, the difference to pay between the fares is a lot of extra money that I hadn't","words":[["Well,",255.24,255.6],["still,",255.88,256.32],["the",257.0,257.14],["difference",257.14,257.42],["to",257.42,257.64],["pay",257.64,257.86],["between",257.86,258.12],["the",258.12,258.36],["fares",258.36,258.64],["is",258.64,258.78],["a",258.78,258.9],["lot",258.9,259.18],["of",259.18,259.4],["extra",259.4,259.72],["money",259.72,260.0],["that",260.0,260.24],["I",260.24,260.42],["hadn't",260.42,260.66]]},{"start":260.66,"end":266.88,"text":"budgeted for. It seems to me that your rules discriminate against a parent travelling on","words":[["budgeted",260.66,261.16],["for.",261.16,261.44],["It",262.1,262.26],["seems",262.26,262.6],["to",262.6,262.86],["me",262.86,263.14],["that",263.14,263.96],["your",263.96,264.22],["rules",264.22,264.5],["discriminate",264.5,265.14],["against",265.14,265.72],["a",265.72,265.94],["parent",265.94,266.24],["travelling",266.24,266.6],["on",266.6,266.88]]},{"start":266.88,"end":272.16,"text":"their own with the children, and also families with lots of children. And what about school","words":[["their",266.88,267.0],["own",267.0,267.34],["with",267.34,267.58],["the",267.58,267.74],["children,",267.74,268.22],["and",268.6,268.9],["also",268.9,269.18],["families",269.18,269.56],["with",269.56,269.86],["lo